            {{ heading({
              text: "Childhood vaccination coverage",
              caption: {
                text: "Updated Wednesday 5 August 2026",
                placement: "after",
                size: "m",
                element: "p"
              },
              size: "l",
              level: 2
            }) }}

            {{ heading({
              text: "Time series",
              size: "m",
              level: 3,
              classes: "nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-2"
            }) }}

            <p class="nhsuk-body">Annual immunisation coverage is calculated and reported by financial year (1 April to 31 March). In time series data, coverage statistics for a given year are tied to the end of respective financial year. For example, annual coverage for the 2022–2023 reporting year is represented by March 2023.</p>
          </div>

          <hr class="nhsuk-section-break nhsuk-section-break--l nhsuk-section-break--visible">
        </div>
